---
title: Sign-in flow
---
flowchart TD
    start([User opens app]) --> session{Valid session?}
    session -->|yes| home[Show home screen]
    session -->|no| login[Login page]
    login --> idp[Redirect to identity provider]
    idp --> mfa{MFA required?}
    mfa -->|yes| otp[Ask one-time code]
    mfa -->|no| token[Issue tokens]
    otp --> check{Code correct?}
    check -->|yes| token
    check -->|no, retry| otp
    token --> home
